        "AcceptedAnswerId": "27",
        "AnswerCount": "2",
        "Body": "&lt;p&gt;Is it realistic or thought neccesary to develop a plugin/feature for this site, to automatically add a small info-box about a thingiverse link? An example of this is Apple's 3D touch technology. In theory, the plugin could recogize thingiverse links in questions and answers, replace the link with an image and the author/name of the project.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I'm also volunteering myself to help with this if there's interest. (Experience with Thingiverse API)&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;",
        "CommentCount": "0",
        "ContentLicense": "CC BY-SA 3.0",
        "CreationDate": "2016-01-12T22:26:52.990",
        "Id": "19",
        "LastActivityDate": "2016-01-14T14:42:16.973",
        "OwnerUserId": "107",
        "PostTypeId": "1",
