        "@text": "",
        "AnswerCount": "2",
        "Body": "&lt;p&gt;Our site has the default Stack Exchange logo (text balloon with text 3D), is it possible to change this logo?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I was thinking of something like this:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://i.sstatic.net/n4VXE.png&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noreferrer&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.sstatic.net/n4VXE.png&quot; alt=&quot;enter image description here&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;or&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://i.sstatic.net/w05Jd.png&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noreferrer&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.sstatic.net/w05Jd.png&quot; alt=&quot;enter image description here&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;If it is possible, we could try to write out a competition and vote! E.g. instead of the lines, the printed image of 3D&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;",
