        "@index": 0,
        "@tail": null,
        "@text": "",
        "AnswerCount": "1",
        "Body": "&lt;p&gt;I'm asking this on Meta because it clearly is off-topic for 3D printing, but there is enough in common someone here may know.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;What is the SE group for CNC routers, such as the multitude of 4060, 4040, and 3018 routers on Amazon and eBay?  I'd like to find a community and find some guidance.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;",
        "CommentCount": "1",
        "ContentLicense": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "CreationDate": "2021-08-06T02:36:21.963",
        "Id": "526",
        "LastActivityDate": "2021-08-06T05:19:35.463",
