        "@index": 0,
        "@tail": null,
        "@text": "",
        "Body": "&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Hotbed.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Colloquially, &quot;hotbed&quot; generally refers to a center of activity. Here, it will have a double meaning (referencing the hot bed of a 3D printer.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;",
        "CommentCount": "0",
        "ContentLicense": "CC BY-SA 3.0",
        "CreationDate": "2016-01-13T21:08:20.493",
        "Id": "52",
        "LastActivityDate": "2016-01-13T21:08:20.493",
