        "AnswerCount": "1",
        "Body": "&lt;p&gt;Can somebody please delete &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/10568/calibrating-y-axis-monoprice-wanhao-prusa&quot;&gt;this question&lt;/a&gt; as it is useless as it stands, and I am apparently not allowed to do it myself.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;",
