        "@index": 0,
        "@tail": null,
        "@text": "",
        "AnswerCount": "2",
        "Body": "&lt;p&gt;In conjunction with &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.meta.stackexchange.com/questions/303/do-we-have-standardised-comments&quot;&gt;Do we have Standardised Comments?&lt;/a&gt;, we should help new users by giving them Templates to fill out so they can help us help them!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;",
