        "AcceptedAnswerId": "302",
        "AnswerCount": "1",
        "Body": "&lt;p&gt;We have &lt;a href=&quot;https://crypto.meta.stackexchange.com/questions/129/a-guide-to-moderating-crypto-stackexchange-yourself-close-voting&quot;&gt;an awesome guide on close voting&lt;/a&gt; posted by Ninefingers for crypto.SE. I'll just copy it to our meta-&lt;a href=&quot;/questions/tagged/faq&quot; class=&quot;post-tag moderator-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;faq&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;faq&lt;/a&gt;, with a few tweaks.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;",
        "CommentCount": "0",
        "CommunityOwnedDate": "2018-07-18T23:30:18.703",
        "ContentLicense": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "CreationDate": "2018-07-18T23:26:49.377",
        "Id": "301",
        "LastActivityDate": "2018-07-18T23:30:18.703",
