      {
        "": "row",
        "-": "posts",
        "--": null,
        "@index": 0,
        "@tail": null,
        "@text": "",
        "AnswerCount": "1",
        "Body": "&lt;p&gt;Hm strange behaviour of one badge.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;So... I asked 3 questions, all three have positive score.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/409/what-are-the-pros-and-cons-of-collecting-parts-yourself-versus-getting-a-diy-ki&quot;&gt;What are the pros and cons of collecting parts yourself, versus getting a DIY kit and then modifying it?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/410/difference-between-pla-and-abs&quot;&gt;How to choose a right 3D printer filament type?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/413/how-to-smooth-3d-printed-objects-without-using-sanding&quot;&gt;Methods for smoothing 3D objects&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;My curious badge stays on 0/5. Why is that so?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;",
        "CommentCount": "1",
        "ContentLicense": "CC BY-SA 3.0",
        "CreationDate": "2016-02-02T10:02:20.050",
        "Id": "89",
        "LastActivityDate": "2016-05-26T19:40:40.207",
        "LastEditDate": "2017-04-13T13:00:57.920",
