        "Title": "Are questions discussing printer construction, internals, and firmware on-topic here?",
        "ViewCount": "70"
      },
      {
        "": "row",
        "-": "posts",
        "--": null,
        "@index": 0,
        "@tail": null,
        "@text": "",
        "AcceptedAnswerId": "22",
        "AnswerCount": "1",
        "Body": "&lt;p&gt;When attempting to access the review cue for close votes,the cue hangs and errors out. &lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The error states - An error occurred when loading the review item, please try again.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I am able to open review cues on other sites.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;",
        "CommentCount": "7",
        "ContentLicense": "CC BY-SA 3.0",
        "CreationDate": "2016-01-12T20:33:56.373",
        "Id": "7",
        "LastActivityDate": "2016-01-12T23:05:23.980",
