        "@index": 0,
        "@tail": null,
        "@text": "",
        "Body": "&lt;p&gt;I'll try my hand at it and try to get the ball rolling.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.sstatic.net/CBJNE.png&quot; alt=&quot;Been here?&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;",
