        "": "row",
        "-": "posts",
        "--": null,
        "@index": 0,
        "@tail": null,
        "@text": "",
        "Body": "&lt;p&gt;here is another proposition&#xA;it's as &quot;native&quot; as possible i think :)&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://i.sstatic.net/zbU4j.png&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noreferrer&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.sstatic.net/zbU4j.png&quot; alt=&quot;enter image description here&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;it's jut a draft so all those curves will be tuned&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;but i wanted to show the idea&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;",
        "CommentCount": "1",
        "ContentLicense": "CC BY-SA 3.0",
        "CreationDate": "2017-09-08T14:36:09.237",
