      },
      {
        "": "row",
        "-": "posts",
        "--": null,
        "@index": 0,
        "@tail": null,
        "@text": "",
        "Body": "&lt;p&gt;I have retagged all of the &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/diy&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;diy&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;diy&lt;/a&gt; as &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/diy-3d-printer&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;diy-3d-printer&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;diy-3d-printer&lt;/a&gt; and removed the &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/diy&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;diy&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;diy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In fact, 6 out of the 7 were already tagged &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/diy-3d-printer&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;diy-3d-printer&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;diy-3d-printer&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;",
        "CommentCount": "0",
        "ContentLicense": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "CreationDate": "2018-07-06T13:17:46.400",
        "Id": "288",
        "LastActivityDate": "2018-07-06T13:17:46.400",
        "OwnerUserId": "4762",
