        "@index": 0,
        "@tail": null,
        "@text": "",
        "Body": "&lt;p&gt;3D scanning to generate 3D printable objects, and subsequently photogrammetry as one way to achieve 3D scans should be &lt;strong&gt;On Topic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;",
