        "Body": "&lt;h1&gt;Ultimaker Cura&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This has some options:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Keep &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/cura&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;cura&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;cura&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Rename to &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/ultimaker-cura&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;ultimaker-cura&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;ultimaker-cura&lt;/a&gt;, alias &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/cura&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;cura&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;cura&lt;/a&gt; to it.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Keep &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/cura&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;cura&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;cura&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;and&lt;/em&gt; alias &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/ultimaker-cura&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;ultimaker-cura&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;ultimaker-cura&lt;/a&gt; to it.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Type: Variant 2, official name.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Status: &lt;strong&gt;DONE&lt;/strong&gt; by Greenonline&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;",
