        "@text": "",
        "Body": "&lt;h1&gt;Printer manufacturer: Creality&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Status: &lt;strong&gt;Done&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Note that the tag for this manufacturer &lt;strong&gt;does not exist&lt;/strong&gt;, printers are listed solely by the printer model type/name: &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/cr-10&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;cr-10&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;cr-10&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/ender-3&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;ender-3&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;ender-3&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/ender-4&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;ender-4&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;ender-4&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/ender-5&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;ender-5&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;ender-5&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In the light of FlashForge and Ultimaker, shouldn't the manufacturer be included (prefixed) in the tag?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;",
        "CommentCount": "4",
        "ContentLicense": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "CreationDate": "2019-08-31T20:44:04.490",
        "Id": "436",
        "LastActivityDate": "2019-12-11T06:16:12.903",
        "LastEditDate": "2020-06-18T08:29:38.190",
        "LastEditorUserId": "-1",
