        "@index": 0,
        "@tail": null,
        "@text": "",
        "Body": "&lt;h1&gt;Ultimaker 1&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Technically the &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/ultimaker-1&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;ultimaker-1&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;ultimaker-1&lt;/a&gt; is named &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/ultimaker-original&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;ultimaker-original&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;ultimaker-original&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Type: Rename&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Status: &lt;strong&gt;DONE&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/users/5740/0scar&quot;&gt;0scar&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;",
        "CommentCount": "0",
        "ContentLicense": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "CreationDate": "2019-08-31T20:46:57.160",
        "Id": "437",
        "LastActivityDate": "2019-08-31T22:09:05.460",
        "LastEditDate": "2020-06-18T08:29:38.190",
