        "Body": "&lt;h1&gt;Manufacturer: E3D&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Status: &lt;strong&gt;Done&lt;/strong&gt;/split up&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.meta.stackexchange.com/a/438/8884&quot;&gt;Takeover from Summer 2019&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We have a lot of questions tagged &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/e3d&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;e3d&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;e3d&lt;/a&gt;. Some concearn the &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/e3d-v6&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;e3d-v6&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;e3d-v6&lt;/a&gt;, one the &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/e3d-titan-aero&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;e3d-titan-aero&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;e3d-titan-aero&lt;/a&gt;, I think I have seen at least one &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/e3d-volcano&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;e3d-volcano&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;e3d-volcano&lt;/a&gt;. As of today (updated), there's a pair of &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/e3d-hemera&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;e3d-hemera&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;e3d-hemera&lt;/a&gt;/(formerly: &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/e3d-hemes&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;e3d-hemes&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;e3d-hemes&lt;/a&gt;) and a single &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/e3d-v5&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;e3d-v5&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;e3d-v5&lt;