        "@tail": null,
        "@text": "",
        "Body": "&lt;h1&gt;Filled-PLA&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Status: &lt;strong&gt;TBD&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Type: &lt;strong&gt;TBD: Alias/Synonym or Rename&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.meta.stackexchange.com/a/434/8884&quot;&gt;Takeover from Summer 2019&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/filled-pla&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;filled-pla&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;filled-pla&lt;/a&gt; (current) reasonably gets the point across&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/blended-pla&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;blended-pla&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;blended-pla&lt;/a&gt; would be a good synonym or alternate name&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/modified-pla&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;modified-pla&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;modified-pla&lt;/a&gt; seems to be used synonymously but could be understood as a master-term for &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/pla%2b&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;pla+&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;pla+&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/htpla&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;htpla&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;htpla&lt;/a&gt; too.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;",
        "CommentCount": "1",
        "ContentLicense": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "CreationDate": "2019-12-08T10:32:43.973",
        "Id": "458",
        "LastActivityDate": "2019-12-08T10:32:43.973",
        "LastEditDate": "2020-06-18T08:29:38.190",
        "LastEditorUserId": "-1",
        "OwnerUserId": "8884",
        "ParentId": "453",
        "PostTypeId": "2",
        "Score": "0"
      },
      {
        "": "row",
        "-": "posts",
        "--": null,
        "@index": 0,
        "@tail": null,
        "@text": "",
        "Body": "&lt;h1&gt;Repair vs. Maintenance&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Status: &lt;strong&gt;TBD&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We have both a &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/repair&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;repair&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;repair&lt;/a&gt; and a &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/maintenance&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;maintenance&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;maintenance&lt;/a&gt; tag with 10 and 25 Questions respectively. Repair is described as:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;Use this tag to indicate the actions or activities to undertake to fix an item or a process.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;while Maintenance is&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;Questions about general maintenance and upkeep of printers.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I would like to redraw the distinguishing line, which is rather blurry:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Maintenance can be replacing worn parts, which also could be seen as repair if it brings a machine back to specs.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;some maintenance tagged questions are also &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/troubleshooting&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;troubleshooting&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;troubleshooting&lt;/a&gt;, which means they could equally well be tagged repair&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;other maintenance tagged questions are tagged with &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/replacement-parts&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;replacement-parts&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;replacement-parts&lt;/a&gt;, which would imply a repair of the first type happening as part of routine maintenance (and could arguable count as a repair)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;As those tags are rather similar, we need to find a solution:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Redraw the line and distinguish better, maybe recategorize parts.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;maybe &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/model-repair&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;model-repair&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;model-repair&lt;/a&gt; vs. &lt;a href=&quot;https://3dprinting.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/printer-maintenance&quot; class=&quot;post-tag&quot; title=&quot;show questions tagged &amp;#39;printer-maintenance&amp;#39;&quot; rel=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;printer-maintenance&lt;/a&gt;?&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Merge the tags into one or the other (maintenance is more inclusive), alias one to the other?&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Keep as it is?&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Other?&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;",
        "CommentCount": "1",
        "ContentLicense": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "CreationDate": "2019-12-08T10:47:05.150",
        "Id": "459",
        "LastActivityDate": "2019-12-08T10:47:05.150",
        "OwnerUserId": "8884",
        "ParentId": "453",
        "PostTypeId": "2",
        "Score": "0"
      },
