        "@index": 0,
        "@tail": null,
        "@text": "",
        "Body": "&lt;p&gt;I don't think there is one, at least not &lt;em&gt;specifically&lt;/em&gt; for CNC. We are the closest to CNC stuff I believe.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;You could try &lt;a href=&quot;https://engineering.stackexchange.com/&quot;&gt;SE.Engineering&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Or go to &lt;a href=&quot;https://area51.stackexchange.com/&quot;&gt;Area51&lt;/a&gt; and try to start a new group.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;",
