        "@index": 0,
        "@tail": null,
        "@text": "",
        "Body": "&lt;p&gt;As of version 4 the splash screen has changed, also the branding/naming of the product throughout Ultimaker's website.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://i.sstatic.net/1eX3U.png&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noreferrer&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.sstatic.net/1eX3U.png&quot; alt=&quot;enter image description here&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Technically it is not &lt;em&gt;CURA&lt;/em&gt; or &lt;em&gt;cura&lt;/em&gt;, it is &lt;em&gt;Ultimaker Cura&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;",
        "CommentCount": "2",
        "ContentLicense": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "CreationDate": "2021-11-26T09:59:10.513",
        "Id": "535",
        "LastActivityDate": "2021-11-26T09:59:10.513",
        "OwnerUserId": "5740",
