        "--": null,
        "@index": 0,
        "@tail": null,
        "@text": "",
        "Body": "&lt;h3&gt;Adding image hover tags&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;After the image URL, if you repeat the image description in quotes, like this:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;[![This is a hi res image][3]][3]&#xA;&#xA;...&#xA;&#xA;  [3]: https://i.sstatic.net/SoOVE.jpg &amp;quot;This is a hi res image&amp;quot;&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;then when you hover the mouse cursor over the image, the usually invisible (and seemingly pointless) image description now shows up in a &amp;quot;hover tag/label&amp;quot;. Try it with this image:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://i.sstatic.net/SoOVE.jpg&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noreferrer&quot; title=&quot;This is a hi res image&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.sstatic.net/SoOVE.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;This is a hi res image&quot; title=&quot;This is a hi res image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This gives new rhyme and reason for adding &lt;em&gt;meaningful&lt;/em&gt; description image descriptions, i.e.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;[![Extruder][1]][1]&#xA;&#xA;[![Knurled drive gear][2]][2]&#xA;&#xA;...&#xA;&#xA;  [1]: https://i.sstatic.net/SoOVE.jpg &amp;quot;Extruder&amp;quot;&#xA;  [2]: https://i.sstatic.net/zFo8A.png &amp;quot;Knurled drive gear&amp;quot;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;rather than just&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;[![photo 1][1]][1]&#xA;&#xA;[![photo 2][2]][2]&#xA;&#xA;...&#xA;&#xA;  [1]: https://i.sstatic.net/SoOVE.jpg&#xA;  [2]: https://i.sstatic.net/zFo8A.png&#xA;&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;or the standard boring&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;[![enter image description here][1]][1]&#xA;&#xA;[![enter image description here][2]][2]&#xA;&#xA;...&#xA;&#xA;  [1]: https://i.sstatic.net/SoOVE.jpg&#xA;  [2]: https://i.sstatic.net/zFo8A.png&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;",
        "CommentCount": "0",
        "ContentLicense": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "CreationDate": "2023-11-27T21:53:13.430",
        "Id": "588",
        "LastActivityDate": "2023-11-27T21:53:13.430",
